00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Inside Balamb Garden, emergency alarms begin to blare throughout the entire structure. Red warning lights flash in corridors.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Garden staff and students react with alarm to the news of incoming missile threats. Personnel rush through hallways in urgent motion.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Internal systems activate with mechanical sounds and whirring as hidden defense mechanisms and lift procedures begin their initialization.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The camera shows various levels of Garden as personnel scramble to their stations, bracing for the incoming attack from Galbadia.
